{"path": "/alumni/", "title": "Alumni – Union Catholic Cross Country | Track + Field", "description": "VIKINGS AT THE NEXT LEVELFrom Union Catholic to college competition.For more than two decades, Union Catholic cross country and track & field athletes have continued their careers at…", "ogImage": "/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/cropped-cropped-uctflogoheader.png", "ogType": "website", "bodyClass": "wp-singular page-template-default page page-id-97 wp-custom-logo wp-embed-responsive wp-theme-uc-championship", "mainId": "primary", "mainClass": "site-main inner-page", "live": {}, "styles": ["main.css", "uc-pages.css", "uc-refresh.css"], "headInline": [], "scripts": [{"src": "/assets/main.js"}, {"src": "/assets/uc-pages.js"}], "html": "\n<section class=\"inner-hero\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"inner-hero__overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"site-shell inner-hero__content\">\n<h1>Alumni</h1>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inner-hero__rule\"></span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section inner-content-section\">\n<div class=\"site-shell article-shell\">\n<article class=\"article article--page post-97 page type-page status-publish hentry\">\n<div class=\"article__content entry-content\"><div class=\"uah\">\n<section class=\"uah-hero\"><div><p class=\"k\">VIKINGS AT THE NEXT LEVEL</p><h2>From Union Catholic to college competition.</h2><p>For more than two decades, Union Catholic cross country and track &amp; field athletes have continued their careers at colleges and universities across the country.</p><p class=\"acts\"><a class=\"btn uc-join-private-hub\" href=\"/alumni-hub/\">JOIN THE PRIVATE ALUMNI HUB →</a><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://forms.gle/K9Uebh7YnrA3RUND6\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">ADD OR UPDATE AN ALUM →</a><a href=\"#dir\">BROWSE DIRECTORY ↓</a></p></div><b class=\"uc\">UC<small>ALUMNI</small></b></section>\n<section class=\"stats\"><div><b>159</b><span>VERIFIED COLLEGE ALUMNI</span></div><div><b>95</b><span>COLLEGES + UNIVERSITIES</span></div><div><b>21</b><span>GRADUATING CLASSES VERIFIED</span></div><div><b>2006</b><span>VERIFIED ARCHIVE BEGINS</span></div></section>\n<section class=\"pics\"><figure><img alt=\"Sydney McLaughlin competing for Union Catholic\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/SydneyMcLaughlin.jpg\"/><figcaption><b>Sydney McLaughlin</b><span>UC ’17 • Kentucky</span></figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jimmy Wischusen representing Union Catholic\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/JimmyWischusen.jpeg\"/><figcaption><b>Jimmy Wischusen</b><span>UC ’24 • Virginia</span></figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Taylor Cox representing Union Catholic\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/TaylorCox.png\"/><figcaption><b>Taylor Cox</b><span>UC ’25 • Georgia</span></figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Nick Givan competing for Union Catholic\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/NickGivan-scaled.jpg\"/><figcaption><b>Nick Givan</b><span>UC ’22 • Georgetown</span></figcaption></figure></section>\n<section class=\"dir\" id=\"dir\"><header><div><p class=\"k\">COLLEGE ALUMNI DIRECTORY</p><h2>Vikings who continued at the next level.</h2></div><p>Search by athlete or college, or choose a graduating class. Newest classes appear first.</p></header><div class=\"tools\"><label>SEARCH<input autocomplete=\"off\" id=\"as\" placeholder=\"Athlete or college…\" type=\"search\"/></label><label>CLASS<select id=\"ay\"><option value=\"\">All classes</option><option>2026</option><option>2025</option><option>2024</option><option>2023</option><option>2022</option><option>2021</option><option>2020</option><option>2019</option><option>2018</option><option>2017</option><option>2016</option><option>2015</option><option>2014</option><option>2013</option><option>2012</option><option>2011</option><option>2010</option><option>2009</option><option>2008</option><option>2007</option><option>2006</option></select></label><span id=\"ar\">Showing 159 verified alumni</span></div><div id=\"alist\"></div><noscript>Please enable JavaScript to view the searchable alumni directory.</noscript></section>\n<section class=\"early\"><div><p class=\"k\">2000–2005</p><h2>Help complete the early archive.</h2><p>We researched 2000 through 2005, but reliable public college-signing and roster records from that period are limited. Rather than guess, those years remain open for verified additions from alumni, families and teammates.</p></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://forms.gle/K9Uebh7YnrA3RUND6\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">SUBMIT A MISSING ALUM →</a></section>\n<p class=\"note\"><b>ABOUT THIS ARCHIVE</b><br/>The directory is built from Union Catholic’s previous alumni list, UC signing-day announcements, college athletics rosters and established track databases. Duplicate names were removed and obvious college-name errors were corrected. Research updated September 2026.</p>\n<script>(function(){window.addEventListener('load',function(){var box=document.getElementById('alist'),search=document.getElementById('as'),year=document.getElementById('ay'),result=document.getElementById('ar');if(!box||!search||!year||!result)return;var D={};box.querySelectorAll('details.yr').forEach(function(d){var m=(d.querySelector('summary')||{}).textContent.match(/Class of (\\d{4})/);if(!m)return;D[m[1]]=[];d.querySelectorAll('.ae').forEach(function(a){D[m[1]].push([(a.querySelector('b')||{}).textContent||'',(a.querySelector('span')||{}).textContent||'']);});});var add={'2026':[['Natalia Thompson','University of New Haven']],'2025':[['Gavin Naar','Hampton University'],['RJ Ingleton','Montclair State University']],'2024':[['Dylan Williams','St. Peter’s University']],'2021':[['Connor Cooper','University of Rhode Island']]};Object.keys(add).forEach(function(k){D[k]=D[k]||[];add[k].forEach(function(x){if(!D[k].some(function(y){return y[0]===x[0];}))D[k].push(x);});});var ns=search.cloneNode(true),ny=year.cloneNode(true);search.parentNode.replaceChild(ns,search);year.parentNode.replaceChild(ny,year);search=ns;year=ny;function esc(v){return String(v).replace(/[&<>\"']/g,function(c){return{'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'}[c];});}function draw(){var q=(search.value||'').trim().toLowerCase(),selected=year.value,count=0,html='';Object.keys(D).sort(function(a,b){return b-a;}).forEach(function(k){if(selected&&selected!==k)return;var alumni=D[k].filter(function(x){return !q||(x[0]+' '+x[1]).toLowerCase().indexOf(q)>-1;});if(!alumni.length)return;count+=alumni.length;var open=(+k>=2024||q||selected)?' open':'';html+='<details class=\"yr\"'+open+'><summary>Class of '+k+'<i>'+alumni.length+' alumni</i></summary><div class=\"grid\">'+alumni.map(function(x){return'<article class=\"ae\"><b>'+esc(x[0])+'</b><span>'+esc(x[1])+'</span></article>';}).join('')+'</div></details>';});box.innerHTML=html;result.textContent='Showing '+count+' of 159 verified alumni';}search.addEventListener('input',draw);year.addEventListener('change',draw);draw();});})();</script></div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n"}